<title>USA: Bio-Rad CFO Braje retires.</title>
<headline>Bio-Rad CFO Braje retires.</headline>
<dateline>HERCULES, Calif 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bio-Rad Laboratories Inc said Thomas Braje was retiring as the company's vice president and chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Braje's retirement was effective immediately, it said.</p>
<p>The company said it would name his replacement at a later date.</p>
<p>Bio-Rad Laboratories manufactures and distributes life science research products, clinical diagnostics and analytical instruments.</p>
